# bat, themed by Omarchy.
#
# The `ansi` theme renders using the terminal's own 16 colors instead of a
# bundled tmTheme. Omarchy retints the terminal on every theme change, so bat
# follows along for free -- no template and no per-theme .tmTheme to maintain.
#
# The Arch config (../../../bat/.config/bat/config) pins "Catppuccin Mocha"
# instead, which is why this is scoped separately.
--theme="ansi"
